# Local models in Cursor

`registry/local-models.json` is the roster. `registry/cursor-local-models.json` is the picker pack. Install the desktop plugin with `scripts/Install-CursorLocalModels.ps1 -Apply`.

Cursor does not auto-discover `/v1/models`. Cloud Agents and hosted Cursor sessions keep using Cursor-hosted models. Loopback Ollama (`http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1`) and OmniRoute (`http://127.0.0.1:20128/v1`) are desktop-only.

Do not pull Ollama weights, change OmniRoute defaults, write API keys, edit `state.vscdb`, enable tunnels, or mutate the canonical queue from this roster.

